<title>JAPAN: Citizen to form watch venture in India.</title>
<headline>Citizen to form watch venture in India.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizen Watch Co Ltd said on Tuesday that it would set up a joint venture in India to produce and sell watches.</p>
</text>
